{
  "total_duration": 85.16,
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "segments": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "来看第十七题，概率分布。",
      "file": "seg_001.wav",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 2.24,
      "duration": 2.24
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "用一个球投篮练习，至多投篮N次。",
      "file": "seg_002.wav",
      "start": 2.74,
      "end": 5.62,
      "duration": 2.88
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "当且仅当投中1次或N次都没中时停止。",
      "file": "seg_003.wav",
      "start": 6.12,
      "end": 9.8,
      "duration": 3.68
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "每次投中概率为p，各次独立。",
      "file": "seg_004.wav",
      "start": 10.3,
      "end": 12.86,
      "duration": 2.56
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "X为停止时的投篮次数。",
      "file": "seg_005.wav",
      "start": 13.36,
      "end": 15.44,
      "duration": 2.08
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "第一问，N等于4，p等于3分之1，求X的分布列。",
      "file": "seg_006.wav",
      "start": 15.94,
      "end": 20.42,
      "duration": 4.48
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "X的可能取值是1、2、3、4。",
      "file": "seg_007.wav",
      "start": 20.92,
      "end": 25.08,
      "duration": 4.16
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "X等于1：第一次就投中。概率等于3分之1。",
      "file": "seg_008.wav",
      "start": 25.58,
      "end": 29.74,
      "duration": 4.16
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "X等于2：第一次没中，第二次投中。概率等于3分之2乘以3分之1，等于9分之2。",
      "file": "seg_009.wav",
      "start": 30.24,
      "end": 37.6,
      "duration": 7.36
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "X等于3：前两次没中，第三次投中。概率等于27分之4。",
      "file": "seg_010.wav",
      "start": 38.1,
      "end": 44.5,
      "duration": 6.4
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "X等于4：要么第三次没中第四次投中，要么四次都没中。",
      "file": "seg_011.wav",
      "start": 45.0,
      "end": 50.6,
      "duration": 5.6
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "概率等于81分之8加81分之16，等于81分之24，等于27分之8。",
      "file": "seg_012.wav",
      "start": 51.1,
      "end": 59.1,
      "duration": 8.0
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "验证：所有概率加起来等于1。",
      "file": "seg_013.wav",
      "start": 59.6,
      "end": 62.16,
      "duration": 2.56
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "第二问，证明条件概率的性质。",
      "file": "seg_014.wav",
      "start": 62.66,
      "end": 65.38,
      "duration": 2.72
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "当k加m小于等于N减1时，P(X大于k加m除以X大于k)等于P(X大于m)。",
      "file": "seg_015.wav",
      "start": 65.88,
      "end": 73.88,
      "duration": 8.0
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "这本质上是无记忆性的证明。",
      "file": "seg_016.wav",
      "start": 74.38,
      "end": 76.78,
      "duration": 2.4
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "因为每次投篮独立，前k次的结果不影响后面的概率。",
      "file": "seg_017.wav",
      "start": 77.28,
      "end": 81.44,
      "duration": 4.16
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "所以条件概率等于无条件概率。",
      "file": "seg_018.wav",
      "start": 81.94,
      "end": 84.66,
      "duration": 2.72
    }
  ]
}